{"id":43522,"date":"2025-07-23T15:23:11","date_gmt":"2025-07-23T14:23:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-da-europa-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-29T10:58:04","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T09:58:04","slug":"maratona-da-europa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-da-europa\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona da Europa (Aveiro) 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona da Europa (Aveiro) 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona da Europa &#8211; Aveiro 2027<\/strong> (7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>24 e 25 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, consagrando-se como uma das provas de estrada mais prestigiadas do calend\u00e1rio internacional e detentora do selo oficial World Athletics Road Race Label. Promovida conjuntamente pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Aveiro<\/strong> e pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de \u00cdlhavo<\/strong>, a prova oferece um tra\u00e7ado extraordinariamente plano e veloz desenhado ao longo dos canais urbanos, da Ria de Aveiro e da orla costeira.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo divide-se em dois dias de celebra\u00e7\u00e3o: no s\u00e1bado, 24 de abril, realiza-se a <strong>Corrida 10K<\/strong> \u00e0s 08h00; no domingo, 25 de abril, decorrem as partidas da prova rainha da <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong> e da <strong>Meia Maratona (21,0975 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 08h00, seguidas da <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 08h15. O evento inclui abastecimentos oficiais, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo e medalha finisher comemorativa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 e 25 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4p